      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "life",
      "text": "'A good harbor has room for people who never go to sea. Nets, ledgers, meals, laundry. Nobody brings a catch home alone.'",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "personal_topic",
          "text": "Remember the children's boat lantern.",
          "next": "personal",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "type": "choice",
              "id": "decide_a",
              "state": "recorded"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "life_back",
          "text": "Thank you.",
          "next": "greeting"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "concern",
      "text": "'The children want a boat-shaped festival lantern. The elders prefer the old harbor star.'",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "decide_a",
          "text": "Let the children make the boat this year.",
          "next": "outcome_a",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "type": "flag",
              "id": "suri_decision",
              "state": "eq",
              "value": 0
            }
          ],
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "flag",
              "id": "suri_decision",
              "value": 1
            }
          ],
          "once": true,
          "result": "Suri remembered your advice: Let the children make the boat this year."
        },
        {
          "id": "decide_b",
          "text": "Make a star with small boats around it.",
          "next": "outcome_b",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "type": "flag",
              "id": "suri_decision",
              "state": "eq",
              "value": 0
            }
          ],
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "flag",
              "id": "suri_decision",
              "value": 2
            }
          ],
          "once": true,
          "result": "Suri remembered your advice: Make a star with small boats around it."
        },
        {
          "id": "concern_back",
          "text": "I need to think about it.",
          "next": "greeting"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "outcome_a",
      "text": "'Then they get the work as well as the choice.' Suri helps them build a frame that will survive the wind.",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "outcome_a_back",
          "text": "Until next time.",
          "next": "greeting"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "outcome_b",
      "text": "'Only if the children help design it.' Suri gives them the center of the workbench instead of instructions from a distance.",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "outcome_b_back",
          "text": "Until next time.",
          "next": "greeting"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "custom",
      "text": "'Shared meals, small repairs, someone noticing when a chair stays empty. Nothing a grand monument could replace.'",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "custom_back",
          "text": "I will remember that.",
          "next": "greeting"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "personal",
      "text": "'They put everyone's initials on the keel. Even mine. I only supplied the string.'",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "personal_back",
          "text": "Thank you.",
          "next": "greeting"
        }
      ]
    }
